  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "We learn about the passion for cooking that started in childhood and led to military kitchen duty. Celebrity restaurant owner Dmitry Nagiyev visits the mess hall, tastes the soup, and offers an incredible opportunity. Listen to the story in Russian first, and then we will examine every line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я всегда знал, что буду поваром.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Не пожарным и не космонавтом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Даже не президентом. А именно поваром.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Вот он, наш герой!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Мне очень понравилась ваша солянка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо! Я очень старалась.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Молодец. Из ничего практически шедевр.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Хотите поработать в хорошем ресторане?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Конечно! Это моя мечта.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Милости просим. Буду рад.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Я говорю совершенно серьёзно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "В каком ресторане?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Ресторан Клод Моне в Москве.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо огромное! Я обязательно приду.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's examine how a simple army soup opened the door to Moscow's culinary elite.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я всегда знал, что буду поваром.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I always knew I would be a chef.' Max reflects on his lifelong certainty about his chosen career path.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Не пожарным и не космонавтом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not a firefighter and not an astronaut.' He lists the typical childhood dreams that he never cared for.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Даже не президентом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not even president.' Even the highest office in the country couldn't tempt him away from the kitchen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А именно поваром.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Specifically a chef.' His focus was always laser-targeted on culinary mastery.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Вот он, наш герой!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here he is, our hero!' Nagiyev warmly greets the young army cook who prepared his meal.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Мне очень понравилась ваша солянка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really liked your solyanka.' The famous guest praises the traditional soup that was served.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо! Я очень старалась.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you! I tried very hard.' Max humbly accepts the compliment, proud of his effort in the kitchen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Молодец.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well done.' Nagiyev offers a short and simple nod of approval for a job well done.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Из ничего практически шедевр.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Practically a masterpiece out of nothing.' The celebrity is amazed at the high quality achieved with basic military ingredients.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Хотите поработать в хорошем ресторане?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you like to work in a good restaurant?' He floats a life-changing proposition to the talented young man.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Конечно! Это моя мечта.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course! That is my dream.' Max eagerly agrees, seeing his ultimate ambition suddenly within reach.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Милости просим. Буду рад.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are welcome. I will be glad.' Nagiyev formally welcomes him, pleased to recruit such raw talent.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Я говорю совершенно серьёзно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am speaking completely seriously.' He assures the young cook that the offer is completely genuine.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Ресторан Клод Моне в Москве.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Restaurant Claude Monet in Moscow.' The famous owner drops the name of his elite establishment in the capital.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо огромное! Я обязательно приду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much! I will definitely come.' Max expresses deep gratitude and promises to show up for the opportunity. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
